# cfuse landscapes: one "name region [origin]" per line.
# Region = the part of the CF API endpoint between "api.cf." and ".hana.ondemand.com".
# Origin = identity provider key (optional): sap.ids for the default SAP IdP,
#          or your custom IdP's origin key. Without it cfuse records the
#          origin of your first login here automatically.
# Tip: `cfuse discover` prints "name region" lines for your subaccounts.
#
# operayo   eu20-001   operayo-platform
# operayo   eu20-001   sap.ids
# customer  eu10
